github.com/EmeraldCityIT/Use-of-Induction-Heating-in-HydroElectric-Generators-to-Increase-Output","stars":1,"forks":2,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Efficiency of modern hydroelectric generator designs can be increased by using induction heating within penstocks and hydro turbines to boil and expand inlet water. The hydroturbine's electricity generation capabilities would power the induction heating surfaces to boiling temperatures. As the water reaches boiling temperatures as it drops from the penstock into the hydro turbine, it's expansion would increase the turbine speed at much greater velocities that the water would without expansion. This design is something that was developed from turbochargers used in automobiles.","topics":[],"score":213762,"global_rank":255724},{"name":"nsmith5/dotfiles","owner":"nsmith5","html_url":"https://github.com/nsmith5/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":"RCM dotfiles (configuration stuff)","topics":[],"score":213761,"global_rank":255727},{"name":"jaredready/terraform-digitalocean-droplet","owner":"jaredready","html_url":"https://github.com/jaredready/terraform-digitalocean-droplet","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"HCL","description":"Provisions a Ghost site on Digital Ocean Droplet with Terraform","topics":[],"score":213761,"global_rank":255728},{"name":"Dustin-Ray/Extended-Euclidian-Algorithm","owner":"Dustin-Ray","html_url":"https://github.com/Dustin-Ray/Extended-Euclidian-Algorithm","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"OCaml","description":"A simple implementation of the extended Euclidian algorithm in OCAML to emphasize the elegance of functional programming languages. ","topics":["extended-euclidean-algorithm","ocaml"],"score":213761,"global_rank":255734},{"name":"WittyAgnomen/Navigation","owner":"WittyAgnomen","html_url":"https://github.com/WittyAgnomen/Navigation","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":